IMPORT prelude
IMPORT domain

-- g4-conflict.l4: Law 5785-2025, section 29: conflict of interest of a Council member.
-- Group G4 (the Registrar and the Council), written by ENCODER G4.  Source: inputs/law.wiki, cited as src:N (quotation lines are copied by
-- script, work/g4/build.py); checked against the gazette (Sefer HaChukim 3349, p. 189).  English beside the Hebrew is the encoder's
-- paraphrase; the Hebrew governs.
--
-- What this module takes as input rather than decides:
--   * who is an "interested party" in a corporation: the Securities Law 1968 defines it (s.29(a), the second definition, is out of scope);
--     each such fact is a BOOLEAN on the record of the party concerned;
--   * whether a financial position is one the member has "an interest" in, whether an interest "conflicts" with the member's function,
--     whether a conflict is "regular", whether it prevents "the main part" of the function: judgements, inputs;
--   * whether the member sits in one of the seats 7 to 11 of s.20 (g4-council-membership decides seats): a BOOLEAN input.
-- It decides the facts g4-council-membership takes as BOOLEAN inputs: `s 29(b) — the person is barred from the Council by regular conflicts of interest`
-- (named `the candidate is barred from the Council by section 29(b)` and `the member is barred from the Council by section 29(b)` there).
-- Imports only prelude and domain: no date is counted in s.29.

§ `Chapter 4: the Registrar and the Council`

§§ `Section 29: conflict of interest`

§§§ `The acts of this section, and the facts it asks about`

DECLARE `An act under section 29` IS ONE OF
    `appoint a person to the Council` HAS
        actor IS A Party
        `the person` IS A STRING
        `the person is barred by section 29(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `serve as a member of the Council` HAS
        actor IS A Party
        `the member is barred by section 29(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `deal with a matter in the member's function` HAS
        actor IS A Party
        `the matter` IS A STRING
        `the way of dealing with the matter` IS A `Way of dealing with a matter under section 29`
        `another way of dealing is handling in the ordinary sense` IS A BOOLEAN
        `dealing with it puts the member in a conflict of interest` IS A BOOLEAN
    `tell the chair of the Council that the member may be in a conflict of interest` HAS
        actor IS A Party
        `as soon as possible` IS A BOOLEAN
    `tell the Minister that the chair may be in a conflict of interest` HAS
        actor IS A Party
        `as soon as possible` IS A BOOLEAN
    `take into account the interests of the public the member represents` HAS
        actor IS A Party

-- s.29(a), the first definition: the relations a "family member" is.  "הורה הורה" is a parent's parent; "בני זוגם" refers to the spouses of a son
-- or daughter; "וילדיהם" to the children of a brother or sister and of an uncle or aunt.  חותן, חותנת, חם and חמות are the parents of a spouse,
-- one constructor for the four words (the four differ by the member's sex and the spouse's, which no rule reads).
-- "לרבות קרוב כאמור שהוא שלוב (חורג)": a step-relation of each kind is included, so `a parent of the member` is a parent or a step-parent: no separate constructor,
-- because inclusion changes no answer.
DECLARE `Kinship to a member of the Council` IS ONE OF
    `a spouse of the member`
    `a parent of the member`
    `a parent of a parent of the member`
    `a child of the member`
    `a spouse of a child of the member`
    `a brother or sister of the member`
    `a child of a brother or sister of the member`
    `a brother-in-law or sister-in-law of the member`
    `an uncle or aunt of the member`
    `a child of an uncle or aunt of the member`
    `a parent of a spouse of the member`
    `a grandchild of the member`
    `a relation section 29(a) does not list`

-- s.29(a), the third definition: "טיפול" includes the five ways below ("לרבות": an open list, so a residue the encoding asks about).
DECLARE `Way of dealing with a matter under section 29` IS ONE OF
    `taking a decision on the matter`
    `raising the subject for discussion`
    `being present at the discussion`
    `taking part in the discussion or in the vote`
    `engaging with the subject outside the discussion`
    `another way of dealing with the matter`

-- s.29(a), the fifth definition: a "relative" is one of four.  The record carries the facts the four categories ask about; the Securities Law's
-- "interested party" (the second definition, out of scope) is a fact on it, not a test.
-- src:231 | {{ח:תת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”בעל עניין“ – כהגדרתו {{ח:חיצוני|חוק ניירות ערך|בחוק ניירות ערך, התשכ״ח–1968}};
@ref s.29(a) def.2 (src:231)
@desc One person or body, in relation to a member of the Council, with the facts the four categories of "relative" ask about
DECLARE `Party in relation to a member of the Council` HAS
    `the kinship to the member` IS A `Kinship to a member of the Council` @desc The party's relation to the member, for category (1)
    `the member has an interest in the financial position of the party` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Category (2): a judgement about the member, an input
    `the party is a corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the party is a corporation (category (3))
    `the member is an interested party in the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc "בעל עניין" as the Securities Law defines it, an external definition: an input
    `a family member of the member is an interested party in the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc The same, for a family member of the member
    `a person the member has an interest in the financial position of is an interested party in the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc The same, for a person of category (2)
    `the party is a body` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the party is a body (category (4))
    `the member manages the body or is a responsible employee in it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc "מנהלים או עובדים אחראים בו"
    `a family member of the member manages the body or is a responsible employee in it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc The same, for a family member of the member
    `a person the member has an interest in the financial position of manages the body or is a responsible employee in it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc The same, for a person of category (2)

-- Who holds an interest that may conflict: the member, or someone else (who counts only if a relative).
DECLARE `Holder of an interest under section 29` IS ONE OF
    `the member as holder`
    `someone else as holder` HAS
        `the party` IS A `Party in relation to a member of the Council`

DECLARE `Kind of interest under section 29` IS ONE OF
    `a personal interest of the holder`
    `another role of the holder`
    `the interest of the public the member represents, as a kind of interest`

@desc One interest that may bear on the performance of the member's function in the Council
DECLARE `Interest bearing on the member's function under section 29` HAS
    `whose interest it is` IS A `Holder of an interest under section 29` @desc The member, or another party
    `the kind of interest` IS A `Kind of interest under section 29` @desc A personal interest, another role, or the interest of the public the member represents
    `it conflicts with the performance of the member's function in the Council` IS A BOOLEAN @desc A judgement: an input
    `it is related to the functions of the Council` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Read only for the interest of the public the member represents (s.29(e))

§§§ `Section 29(a): the definitions`

-- src:230 | {{ח:תת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”בן משפחה“ – בן זוג, הורה, הורה הורה, בן או בת ובני זוגם, אח או אחות וילדיהם, גיס, גיסה, דוד או דודה וילדיהם, חותן, חותנת, חם, חמות, נכד או נכדה, לרבות קרוב כאמור שהוא שלוב (חורג);
@ref s.29(a) def.1 (src:230)
@export Whether a relation to a Council member is that of a "family member" under section 29(a): spouse, parent, grandparent, child and the child's spouse, brother or sister and their children, brother-in-law or sister-in-law, uncle or aunt and their children, a spouse's parent, grandchild, step-relations included
GIVEN kinship IS A `Kinship to a member of the Council` @desc The relation to the member
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 29(a) def.1 — the relation is that of a family member` kinship MEANS
    NOT (kinship EQUALS `a relation section 29(a) does not list`)

-- src:232 | {{ח:תת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”טיפול“ – לרבות קבלת החלטה, העלאת נושא לדיון, נוכחות בדיון, השתתפות בדיון או בהצבעה, או עיסוק בנושא מחוץ לדיון;
@ref s.29(a) def.3 (src:232)
GIVEN way IS A `Way of dealing with a matter under section 29`
      `another way of dealing is handling in the ordinary sense` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 29(a) def.3 — the way of dealing with the matter is handling` way `another way of dealing is handling in the ordinary sense` MEANS
    CONSIDER way
    WHEN `another way of dealing with the matter` THEN `another way of dealing is handling in the ordinary sense`
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- src:235 | {{ח:תתתת|(1)}} בן משפחה של חבר המועצה;
@ref s.29(a) def.5(1) (src:235)
GIVEN party IS A `Party in relation to a member of the Council`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 29(a) def.5(1) — the party is a family member of the member` party MEANS
    `s 29(a) def.1 — the relation is that of a family member` (party's `the kinship to the member`)

-- src:236 | {{ח:תתתת|(2)}} אדם שלחבר המועצה יש עניין במצבו הכלכלי;
@ref s.29(a) def.5(2) (src:236)
GIVEN party IS A `Party in relation to a member of the Council`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 29(a) def.5(2) — the member has an interest in the financial position of the party` party MEANS
    party's `the member has an interest in the financial position of the party`

-- src:237 | {{ח:תתתת|(3)}} תאגיד שחבר המועצה, בן משפחתו או אדם כאמור בפסקה (2) הם בעלי עניין בו;
@ref s.29(a) def.5(3) (src:237)
GIVEN party IS A `Party in relation to a member of the Council`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 29(a) def.5(3) — the party is a corporation in which the member, a family member or a person of category (2) is an interested party` party MEANS
        party's `the party is a corporation`
    AND (    party's `the member is an interested party in the corporation`
         OR  party's `a family member of the member is an interested party in the corporation`
         OR  party's `a person the member has an interest in the financial position of is an interested party in the corporation`)

-- src:238 | {{ח:תתתת|(4)}} גוף שחבר המועצה, בן משפחתו או אדם כאמור בפסקה (2) הם מנהלים או עובדים אחראים בו.
@ref s.29(a) def.5(4) (src:238)
GIVEN party IS A `Party in relation to a member of the Council`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 29(a) def.5(4) — the party is a body that the member, a family member or a person of category (2) manages or is responsibly employed in` party MEANS
        party's `the party is a body`
    AND (    party's `the member manages the body or is a responsible employee in it`
         OR  party's `a family member of the member manages the body or is a responsible employee in it`
         OR  party's `a person the member has an interest in the financial position of manages the body or is a responsible employee in it`)

-- src:234 | {{ח:תת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”קרוב“, של חבר המועצה – כל אחד מאלה:
-- src:235 | {{ח:תתתת|(1)}} בן משפחה של חבר המועצה;
-- src:236 | {{ח:תתתת|(2)}} אדם שלחבר המועצה יש עניין במצבו הכלכלי;
-- src:237 | {{ח:תתתת|(3)}} תאגיד שחבר המועצה, בן משפחתו או אדם כאמור בפסקה (2) הם בעלי עניין בו;
-- src:238 | {{ח:תתתת|(4)}} גוף שחבר המועצה, בן משפחתו או אדם כאמור בפסקה (2) הם מנהלים או עובדים אחראים בו.
@ref s.29(a) def.5 (src:234-238)
@export Whether a person or body is a "relative" of a Council member under section 29(a): a family member, a person in whose financial position the member has an interest, a corporation in which the member, a family member or such a person is an interested party, or a body that they manage or are responsibly employed in
GIVEN party IS A `Party in relation to a member of the Council` @desc The person or body, with the facts the four categories ask about
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 29(a) def.5 — the party is a relative of the member` party MEANS
        `s 29(a) def.5(1) — the party is a family member of the member` party
    OR  `s 29(a) def.5(2) — the member has an interest in the financial position of the party` party
    OR  `s 29(a) def.5(3) — the party is a corporation in which the member, a family member or a person of category (2) is an interested party` party
    OR  `s 29(a) def.5(4) — the party is a body that the member, a family member or a person of category (2) manages or is responsibly employed in` party

§§§ `The definition of a conflict of interest (s.29(a), the fourth definition) and section 29(e)`

-- "ניגוד עניינים בין מילוי תפקידו במועצה לבין עניין אישי או תפקיד אחר, שלו או של קרובו": a conflict between performing the Council function and a
-- personal interest or another role of the member's or of a relative's.  Whether an interest conflicts is a judgement (an input on the interest).
-- An interest held by someone who is not a relative cannot make the member's conflict.
-- s.29(e): a member of seats 7 to 11 may take account of the interests of the public he represents, if related to the Council's functions, and
-- is not "deemed" in conflict for that reason ALONE: such an interest is not counted.  It is still counted for any other member, and when it is
-- not related to the Council's functions.
-- src:233 | {{ח:תת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”ניגוד עניינים“, של חבר המועצה – ניגוד עניינים בין מילוי תפקידו במועצה לבין עניין אישי או תפקיד אחר, שלו או של קרובו;
@ref s.29(a) def.4 (src:233)
GIVEN seats7to11 IS A BOOLEAN
      interest IS AN `Interest bearing on the member's function under section 29`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 29(a) def.4, (e) — the member, who sits in one of the seats 7 to 11:` seats7to11 `, is in a conflict of interest by the interest` interest MEANS
        interest's `it conflicts with the performance of the member's function in the Council`
    AND `the holder counts` (interest's `whose interest it is`)
    AND (NOT `the public's interest is set aside by section 29(e)`)
    WHERE
        `the holder counts` holder MEANS
            CONSIDER holder
            WHEN `the member as holder` THEN TRUE
            WHEN `someone else as holder` party THEN `s 29(a) def.5 — the party is a relative of the member` party
        `the public's interest is set aside by section 29(e)` MEANS
                seats7to11
            AND (CONSIDER interest's `the kind of interest`
                 WHEN `the interest of the public the member represents, as a kind of interest` THEN interest's `it is related to the functions of the Council`
                 OTHERWISE FALSE)

-- src:233 | {{ח:תת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”ניגוד עניינים“, של חבר המועצה – ניגוד עניינים בין מילוי תפקידו במועצה לבין עניין אישי או תפקיד אחר, שלו או של קרובו;
-- src:242 | {{ח:תת|(ה)}} על אף האמור בסעיף זה, חבר המועצה שמונה לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 20|סעיף 20(7) עד (11)}} רשאי להביא בחשבון גם את ענייניו של הציבור שהוא נציגו, אם הם קשורים לתפקידי המועצה, ולא יראו אותו כנמצא במצב של ניגוד עניינים בשל כך בלבד.
@ref s.29(a) def.4 (src:233)
@ref s.29(e) (src:242)
@export Whether a Council member is in a conflict of interest: some interest of the member's, or of a relative's, conflicts with the performance of the Council function, other than the interest of the public represented by a member of seats 7 to 11 where related to the Council's functions
GIVEN seats7to11 IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the member sits in one of the seats 7 to 11 of section 20
      interests IS A LIST OF `Interest bearing on the member's function under section 29` @desc Every interest that may bear on the performance of the function
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 29(a) def.4, (e) — the member, who sits in one of the seats 7 to 11:` seats7to11 `, is in a conflict of interest among the interests` interests MEANS
    any (GIVEN i YIELD `s 29(a) def.4, (e) — the member, who sits in one of the seats 7 to 11:` seats7to11 `, is in a conflict of interest by the interest` i) interests

§§§ `Section 29(b): the bar on appointment and on service`

-- "מי שבשל כהונתו יימצא, באופן תדיר, במצב של ניגוד עניינים אשר ימנע ממנו למלא את עיקר תפקידו": both a regular conflict AND one that prevents the main
-- part of the function.  Both are judgements, inputs.
-- src:239 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} לא ימונה לחבר המועצה ולא יכהן כחבר כאמור מי שבשל כהונתו יימצא, באופן תדיר, במצב של ניגוד עניינים אשר ימנע ממנו למלא את עיקר תפקידו במועצה.
@ref s.29(b) (src:239)
@export Whether a person is barred from the Council by section 29(b): because of the service the person would regularly be in a conflict of interest that prevents the main part of the function
GIVEN regularly IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if, because of the service, the person would be in a conflict of interest regularly
      preventsMainPart IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if that conflict would prevent the person from performing the main part of the function
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 29(b) — the person is barred from the Council by regular conflicts of interest` regularly `with the main part of the function prevented being` preventsMainPart MEANS
        regularly
    AND preventsMainPart

-- "לא ימונה לחבר המועצה": the passive names no actor; the appointer of s.20 is the Minister (FORK F-29b-actor, as for s.21).
@ref s.29(b) (src:239)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under section 29`
`s 29(b) — the Minister must not appoint to the Council a person who would regularly be in a conflict of interest preventing the main part of the function` MEANS
    PARTY `the Minister`
    SHANT `appoint a person to the Council` `the Minister` person barred PROVIDED barred
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the Minister` BECAUSE "s 29(b): a person barred by regular conflicts of interest was appointed to the Council"

-- "ולא יכהן כחבר כאמור": nor may he serve.
@ref s.29(b) (src:239)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under section 29`
`s 29(b) — a member who would regularly be in a conflict of interest preventing the main part of the function must not serve` MEANS
    PARTY `a Council member`
    SHANT `serve as a member of the Council` `a Council member` barred PROVIDED barred
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `a Council member` BECAUSE "s 29(b): a member barred by regular conflicts of interest served"

§§§ `Section 29(c): the bar on handling a matter`

-- "לא יטפל במסגרת תפקידו בנושא שהטיפול בו יגרום לו להימצא במצב של ניגוד עניינים": a member shall not handle a matter whose handling puts him in a
-- conflict.  Handling is the definition above (the five ways and, by judgement, a residue); a prohibition with no time stated has no WITHIN.
-- src:240 | {{ח:תת|(ג)}} חבר המועצה לא יטפל במסגרת תפקידו בנושא שהטיפול בו יגרום לו להימצא במצב של ניגוד עניינים.
@ref s.29(c) (src:240)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under section 29`
`s 29(c) — a member must not handle a matter whose handling puts the member in a conflict of interest` MEANS
    PARTY `a Council member`
    SHANT `deal with a matter in the member's function` `a Council member` matter way anotherWay conflict
          PROVIDED `s 29(a) def.3 — the way of dealing with the matter is handling` way anotherWay AND conflict
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `a Council member` BECAUSE "s 29(c): the member handled a matter whose handling put the member in a conflict of interest"

§§§ `Section 29(d): the duty to tell the chair, or the Minister`

-- "נודע לחבר המועצה כי הוא עלול להימצא במצב של ניגוד עניינים כאמור בסעיפים קטנים (ב) או (ג), יודיע על כך בהקדם האפשרי ליושב ראש המועצה;
-- היה חבר המועצה האמור היושב ראש – יודיע על כך לשר": a member who learns he may be in a conflict under (b) or (c) tells the chair; the chair tells
-- the Minister.  "בהקדם האפשרי" is vague (kind N): a judgement on the act; a late notice is still the notice, but is a breach.
-- src:241 | {{ח:תת|(ד)}} נודע לחבר המועצה כי הוא עלול להימצא במצב של ניגוד עניינים כאמור בסעיפים קטנים (ב) או (ג), יודיע על כך בהקדם האפשרי ליושב ראש המועצה; היה חבר המועצה האמור היושב ראש – יודיע על כך לשר.
@ref s.29(d) (src:241)
GIVEN `the member learned that the member may be in a conflict of interest under section 29(b) or (c)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under section 29`
`s 29(d) — a member who learned of a possible conflict must tell the chair as soon as possible` `the member learned that the member may be in a conflict of interest under section 29(b) or (c)` MEANS
    IF   `the member learned that the member may be in a conflict of interest under section 29(b) or (c)`
    THEN PARTY `a Council member`
         MUST `tell the chair of the Council that the member may be in a conflict of interest` `a Council member` soon
         HENCE (IF soon
                THEN FULFILLED
                ELSE BREACH BY `a Council member` BECAUSE "s 29(d): the chair was not told as soon as possible")
         LEST BREACH BY `a Council member` BECAUSE "s 29(d): the chair was not told that the member may be in a conflict of interest"
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref s.29(d) (src:241)
GIVEN `the chair learned that the chair may be in a conflict of interest under section 29(b) or (c)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under section 29`
`s 29(d) — a chair who learned of a possible conflict must tell the Minister as soon as possible` `the chair learned that the chair may be in a conflict of interest under section 29(b) or (c)` MEANS
    IF   `the chair learned that the chair may be in a conflict of interest under section 29(b) or (c)`
    THEN PARTY `the Council chair`
         MUST `tell the Minister that the chair may be in a conflict of interest` `the Council chair` soon
         HENCE (IF soon
                THEN FULFILLED
                ELSE BREACH BY `the Council chair` BECAUSE "s 29(d): the Minister was not told as soon as possible")
         LEST BREACH BY `the Council chair` BECAUSE "s 29(d): the Minister was not told that the chair may be in a conflict of interest"
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§§ `Section 29(e): taking the public's interests into account`

-- "רשאי להביא בחשבון גם את ענייניו של הציבור שהוא נציגו, אם הם קשורים לתפקידי המועצה": a MAY for a member of seats 7 to 11, if the interests are
-- related to the Council's functions.  (The second half of (e) is in `s 29(a) def.4, (e)` above.)
-- src:242 | {{ח:תת|(ה)}} על אף האמור בסעיף זה, חבר המועצה שמונה לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 20|סעיף 20(7) עד (11)}} רשאי להביא בחשבון גם את ענייניו של הציבור שהוא נציגו, אם הם קשורים לתפקידי המועצה, ולא יראו אותו כנמצא במצב של ניגוד עניינים בשל כך בלבד.
@ref s.29(e) (src:242)
GIVEN seats7to11 IS A BOOLEAN
      related IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under section 29`
`s 29(e) — a member who sits in one of the seats 7 to 11:` seats7to11 `may take into account the interests of the public the member represents, which are related to the Council's functions:` related MEANS
    IF   seats7to11 AND related
    THEN PARTY `a Council member`
         MAY `take into account the interests of the public the member represents` `a Council member`
    ELSE FULFILLED
